# Real-book corpora for the matcher regression suites.
#
# Extracted text and bookmark trees from copyrighted textbooks — ~7.7 MB of
# them. Never committed. The suites look here first, then at
# FIND_ENGINE_CORPUS / FIND_ENGINE_EXPANDED_CORPUS, and skip cleanly when the
# files are absent, so a clone without them still runs green.
